Modifications made in LKina (relative to AutoDock Vina 1.2.7):
  - ag4_engine.cpp / ag4_engine.h  [GPL-3.0-or-later]:
      C++ implementation of the AutoGrid 4.2 pairwise interaction scoring
      function, written with reference to the AutoGrid4 source code.
      Algorithm: Morris et al., J. Comput. Chem. 19:1639-1662 (1998)
                 Morris et al., J. Comput. Chem. 30:2785-2791 (2009)
  - embedded_ad4_grid.cpp / embedded_ad4_grid.h  [GPL-3.0-or-later]:
      Inline AD4 affinity-map generation — generates AutoGrid4-compatible
      maps at docking time without requiring an external autogrid4 binary.
  - ad4_parameter_data.cpp / ad4_parameter_data.h  [GPL-3.0-or-later]:
      Embedded AD4_parameters.dat content from AutoDock4, extended with
      additional metal atom types.
  - ad4cache.cpp / ad4cache.h  [Apache-2.0, modified from AutoDock Vina]:
      Extended to load maps produced by the inline engine.
  - src/main/main.cpp  [Apache-2.0, modified from AutoDock Vina]:
      Added --generate_maps flag; extended metal atom-type support.
  - build/makefile_common  [Apache-2.0, modified from AutoDock Vina]:
      Added LKina build target.

