AutoDock4 force field parameters
The numeric force field parameters embedded in ad4_parameter_data.cpp are
published scientific data from:
  Morris, G.M. et al. (1998) J. Comput. Chem. 19:1639-1662
  Morris, G.M. et al. (2009) J. Comput. Chem. 30:2785-2791
These values are factual scientific constants and are not subject to copyright.
AutoDock 4 upstream source is licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later and
available at https://github.com/ccsb-scripps/AutoDock4.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MetalDock (referenced for ligand-metal parameters)
The reverse metal-donor pair potentials in ag4_engine.cpp consult parameters
published by the MetalDock project. No MetalDock source code is included in
LKina; only published epsilon/r_eq values from the `standard_set` were used
as references. MetalDock is distributed under GPL-3.0.
  Hakkennes, M. et al. (2024) J. Chem. Inf. Model. 64:3538-3550 (PMC10751784)
  Upstream repository: https://github.com/lydiahakkennes/MetalDock
